    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20061211.0325\n\nDOHA, Dec 11 , 2006, 2006\n\nChina's Xie wins women's triple jump title\n\n\n\n\nChina's Xie Limei won the women's triple jump title here at the Asian Games on Monday.\n\nThe 20-year-old jumped a best of 14.37 metres to beat Uzbekistan's Anastasia Juravleva while Li Qian of China took the bronze.",
